      "content": "look i get it but i'm literally broke right now and a clinic visit is gonna cost me a ton. if i just scrub it really hard with alcohol and maybe use some antibiotic ointment like neosporin, isn't that basically doing the same thing? i really think i can just manage this at home if i'm extra careful with the cleaning.",
